t Diapers today and experience the difference comfort can make!\",\n      \"call_to_action\": \"Shop now and give your baby the comfort they deserve! Use code COMFORT10 for 10% off your first order.\"\n    },\n    \"media\": {\n      \"image_urls\": [\n        \"https://example.com/images/snuggle-soft-diaper-newborn.jpg\",\n        \"https://example.com/images/snuggle-soft-diaper-toddler.jpg\",\n        \"https://example.com/images/snuggle-soft-diaper-eco-friendly.jpg\"\n      ],\n      \"video_url\": \"https://example.com/videos/snuggle-soft-diapers-comfort-demo.mp4\"\n    },\n    \"pricing\": {\n      \"price\": 24.99,\n      \"package_contents\": \"24-count pack (sizes vary by package)\",\n      \"bulk_discount\": \"Buy 3 packs, save $10!\"\n    },\n    \"availability\": \"Available online at SnuggleSoftDiapers.com and select retail stores nationwide.\",\n    \"testimonials\": [\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"SnuggleSoft Diapers have been a game-changer for my baby. The softness truly makes a difference, and the wetness indicator is a lifesaver!\",\n        \"author\": \"Sarah L., Mom of a 6-month-old\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"As a parent with a baby with sensitive skin, these diapers have been amazing. No more rashes and my baby sleeps so much better!\",\n        \"author\": \"Michael T., Dad of a 1-year-old\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"guarantee\": {\n      \"satisfaction\": \"100% Satisfaction Guarantee – If you're not happy with SnuggleSoft Diapers, we'll refund your money, no questions asked.\",\n      \"risk_free\": \"Try our 30-day risk-free trial!\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```", "logprobs": [{"token": "```", "logprob": -0.0005511910421773791}, {"token": "json", "logprob": -5.483612312673358e-06}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": "{\n", "logprob": -7.652943895664066e-05}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.0002693767019081861}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -1.5497195136049413e-06}, {"token": "ad", "logprob": -0.02235195413231849